  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans:\r\r9617/1B, 9617/1A, 9617/2A, Block Plan and Location Plan\r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "Unless otherwise specified in the application the materials to be used for the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted along with work of making good shall be carried out in materials to match those of the existing building.\r\rReason: To ensure that the appearance of the development respects the appearance, existing materials and built and natural features of the surrounding area. \r",
    "Notwithstanding details indicated on Drawing No.9617/1B, within 3 months of the permission hereby approved details of \r\ro\tthe siting, design (including secure means of enclosure) of 4 long stay cycle parking spaces \ro\tdetails of communal refuse storage facilities including facilities for the recycling of waste to be provided within the development\ro\t1 car parking space\r\rshall be submitted to the Local Planning Authority for approval. The development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details within 6 months of the date of this permission and thereafter maintained unless otherwise in writing by the Local Planning Authority.\r\rReason: In the interests of highway safety and accessibility and to ensure the provision of cycle parking in line with the Council's adopted standards and in the interests of amenity and the recycling of waste materials in support of the Boroughs waste reduction targets.\r",
    "The use of the property as a House in Multiple Occupation hereby approved shall be occupied by a maximum of 4 people at any one time and shall not be subdivided or occupied as self-contained units. \r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r"
  ],
